🚀 How This Works

✔ Runs every 10 minutes to migrate the next batch of users.
✔ Handles rate limits using Polly retry with exponential backoff.
✔ Processes users in parallel (100 concurrent API calls).
✔ Logs success & failures in SQL Server for resumable migration.


